  "releaseNotes": "Discover.ConnectAsync now de-duplicates concurrent connect calls for the same device (host/port): if a connect is already in flight, other callers await and share the resulting KasaDevice instance instead of each opening an independent TCP connection. This prevents multiple simultaneous sockets/handshakes to devices that tolerate only a small number of concurrent connections when callers race to (re)connect. No public API changes.",
